        "Title": "Paris Payback",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102932257573",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b63d263c-d156-48cc-bb8a-8f7f8c561002).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47.\rWe have intel on two twin undercover terrorists in Paris, intel suggests they are currently taking the guise of bodyguards.\rFirstly, Emilio Richard. Close-Quarter specialist - you&apos;ll want to get close and personal for this one\rSecondly, Charles Le Gars, Explosives expert, By all means 47, send the bastard flying..\r\rLastly - More of a personal grudge. Jose Routhier. A chef working under Novikov. Payback here is due to ending my Silent Assassin run. A lot-\r\rPayback Time, 47.",
        "GameVersion": "8.23.0.0",
